  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_f7657f10-a3e4-4403-a941-928f5bd774ba.png\" alt=\"Serene Seasons 標誌\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fglitchfiend.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_30ec20ea-5378-428a-bd0a-be21297b5ed5.png\" alt=\"追蹤 Bluesky\" width=\"220\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fGlitchfiend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_f430a7ef-e185-440d-b5b3-99734548f12c.png\" alt=\"追蹤 X\" width=\"168\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/GyyzU6T\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_7d333cda-4140-43b3-bbf2-d0644e385d2b.png\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\" width=\"212\" height=\"38\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Adubbz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_db9999be-2c6a-45e2-8b5a-ac137a40758d.png\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持\" width=\"236\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dAdubbzG%2540gmail.com%2526cy_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_4b997f21-953a-40bf-9b62-4142c6df34e4.png\" alt=\"透過 PayPal 捐款\" width=\"218\" height=\"38\"></a></p><h2>描述</h2><hr><h4>Serene Seasons 是一個為 Minecraft 添加季節的模組。草地和樹葉的顏色會隨著一年中的時間變化，而在冬天，溫度會改變，使得一些原本不會下雪的生物群系也能降雪。季節還會影響其他各種功能，如作物生長、天氣等！</h4><h2>資訊與條款</h2><hr><h3>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_a952cee2-0572-4d67-a33c-f5bfde8f4376.png\" alt=\"GlitchCore 圖標\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GlitchCore</a> for Minecraft 1.20.4 及以上*！Fabric 版本還需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>。</h3><p><em>*在 mod 版本 9.1.0.0 及以上時，1.20.1 也需要此前置</em></p><p><em>您可以將此模組包含在 CurseForge 託管的模組包中，前提是您不重新託管該模組，僅使用我們直接上傳的版本，不透過任何方式銷售模組包或對模組的額外存取權限，並且您遵守所使用的模組版本授權中的所有條款。</em></p><h2>Glitchfiend 的其他作品</h2><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_f51ae5df-ff9f-4a50-a39e-16467fb0e877.png\" alt=\"Biomes O' Plenty 標誌\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tough-as-nails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/291874/description_6406d094-d853-4f83-b92b-49accc3b5fd7.png\" alt=\"Tough As Nails 標誌\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></a></p>",
